  "question_stem": "A particle starts from a point $O$ and moves in a straight line. The velocity $v \\mathrm{m s^{-1}}$ of the particle at time $t \\mathrm{s}$ after leaving $O$ is given by $$v = k(3t^2 - 2t^3),$$ where $k$ is a constant.",
